      "text": "- Monolithic architecture :- Simple in nature\n       - Single project doing a lot of responsibility\n       - Code reusability is the advantage of this architecture\n       - When code grows and executables becomes very heavy\n\n                 - Builds -> time consuming\n                 - Tests -> time consuming\n                 - Running and loading the excecutables -> time consuming\n  ",
