      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- It is possible to build multiple projects with different tech-stack based on suitabilty\n- SRP is not violated\n- Code sharing requires comman library management\n- Scaling a independent service is possible\n- Scale product (for heavy reads) , Order MS (for heavy write)\n- Different databases (Not good approach)\n\n\n\n- Moral of the story every backend system/server can be read heavy or write heavy depends \n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- It is possible to build multiple projects with different tech-stack based on suitabilty\n- SRP is not violated\n- Code sharing requires comman library management\n- Scaling a independent service is possible\n- Scale product (for heavy reads) , Order MS (for heavy write)\n- Different databases (Not good approach)\n\n\n\n- Moral of the story every backend system/server can be read heavy or write heavy depends \n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
